# Alembic Migration Environment

## Structure

```
migration/
├── versions/          # Migration files
├── alembic.ini        # Alembic configuration
├── env.py             # Migration environment
├── script.py.mako     # Migration template
├── README
└── __init__.py
```

## Commands

```bash
# Run all pending migrations
uv run alembic -c src/db/migration/alembic.ini upgrade head

# Rollback one migration
uv run alembic -c src/db/migration/alembic.ini downgrade -1

# Generate new migration (auto-detect model changes)
uv run alembic -c src/db/migration/alembic.ini revision --autogenerate -m "description"

# Generate empty migration
uv run alembic -c src/db/migration/alembic.ini revision -m "description"

# Show current migration
uv run alembic -c src/db/migration/alembic.ini current

# Show migration history
uv run alembic -c src/db/migration/alembic.ini history
```
